Recognition identifies incoming message type and routes to appropriate dataflow.

### 5.2 Recognizer Configuration

**File:** `recognizers/<name>RecognizerConfiguration.js`

**Available Recognizer:** `defaultIncomingMessageRecognizer` (only one available)

### 5.3 Rule Types

**Built-in Rule Types:**

1. **XPath** - For XML message content matching (ready to use)
